# Private aliases — company/machine-specific shortcuts
#
# HOW TO USE:
# 1. Copy this file to ~/.dotfiles-private/aliases.zsh
# 2. Add any aliases that reference org-specific paths or tools
# 3. The dotfiles .zshrc sources this file automatically if it exists

